A||||6||gtsonly||What has to be done to a Flowmaster to make it work?????||||5||
Z||000000||gtsonly||12-30-2001||04:49 PM||||I know this has gone into great debate, But what has to be done to the 40 series Flowmaster to make it work in a GT. Other than the Spintech west coast fiero's has, are there any others that will work? My muffler shop said the OEM muffler has welded hangers (4) on it. And that he can weld hangers to a flowmaster but not sure if they will hold.......<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/myfiero001_copy_1.jpg"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||avengador1||12-30-2001||04:53 PM||||The Ocelot exhaust system I have on my car has no hangers on the muffler like the stock muffler had. The pipe hangers hold the whole thing up.As you can see in this picture. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero24_2.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||88CoupeV6||12-30-2001||06:44 PM||||Chris West @ <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A>  sells a modified flowmaster for the Fiero. I am thinking of getting one soon  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
Z||000003||fierodoug5||12-30-2001||07:52 PM||||I have a 80 series Flowmaster on 2 of my cars. Neither are supported from the muffler, just the pipe clamps as in the picture above. It was a pain to install but WELL worth the sound! <BR>Doug Venner    NJ<BR>85 GT, 86 SE, 86 GT, 87 SE||||reg||1
Z||000004||fierodoug5||12-30-2001||07:55 PM||||Avengador1, how do you like the Ocelot system? I have heard good and bad? Howz it sound compared to stock? My 86 SE needs a louder Exhaust! <BR>Doug Venner    NJ<BR>85 GT, 86 SE, 86 GT, 87 SE||||reg||1
Z||000005||Hairy_Fiero||12-30-2001||09:17 PM||||Avengador1, is that pic of the Fiero motor with a flowmaster your engine? And did you do the work? That is absolutely gorgeous!!!! <BR>||||reg||5
Z||000006||avengador1||12-31-2001||08:41 AM||||I have the Ocelot exhaust with reproduction tips. I have it coated with a silver high temperature coating from <A HREF="http://www.eastwoodcompany.com" TARGET=_blank>www.eastwoodcompany.com</A>  I also have the free flow cat and ceramic coated cross-over pipe and sprint manifolds from the Fiero store. I did all the work myself and it sounds awesome. My wife says it's too loud but I have hearded louder cars and have never been stopped for it.<p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 12-31-2001).]||||reg||1
